The harness ledger: specforge-harness records the values only a command's plan sets

Usage: specforge harness <COMMAND>

Commands:
  gc    Write specforge-harness canonically: drop the lines of what the project no longer holds, sort the rest
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
